      "node_id": "C_kwDOABII59oAKDZlYTg1ZjU3ZmJlMzNjMDQ3ZDk1MWY3ZTk0MDAwNzc3MWFlYjQ1NDc",
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bitcoin/bitcoin/git/commits/6ea85f57fbe33c047d951f7e940007771aeb4547",
      "actor": null,
      "commit_id": null,
      "commit_url": null,
      "created_at": null,
      "html_url": "https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/commit/6ea85f57fbe33c047d951f7e940007771aeb4547",
      "tree": {
        "sha": "adfd5b00d26cb3925ccee63fb10187e53df755ba",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bitcoin/bitcoin/git/trees/adfd5b00d26cb3925ccee63fb10187e53df755ba"
      },
      "verification": {
        "verified": true,
        "reason": "valid",
        "payload": "tree adfd5b00d26cb3925ccee63fb10187e53df755ba\nparent bb5296576e8f1a9fc11c19d9a25ba02ed4547e24\nauthor will <will@256k1.dev> 1789034675 +0100\ncommitter will <will@256k1.dev> 1789982755 +0100\n\ndepends: isolate local archives by source path\n\nWorktrees sharing SOURCES_PATH can reuse another worktree's local source\narchive when it is newer than all their source paths. This causes\ndepends to calculate a valid checksum and build ID for the wrong source\ncontents.\n\nInclude the absolute source directory's hash in local archive filenames\nso each worktree checks its own archive for freshness. Retain\nmtime-based invalidation to avoid reading every source file whenever\nmake is parsed.\n\nThis isolates distinct absolute source paths. Containers exposing\ndifferent checkouts at the same path may still need separate\nsource-cache handling.\n\nRefs #35764.\n",
